Lukisan terkenal terkumpul di ruang pameran lantai 2.

276
00:16:41,882 --> 00:16:46,257
Kalau begitu, bagaimana kalau mulai dari lantai 2?

277
00:16:46,280 --> 00:16:51,359
Ya, rute itu sangat direkomendasikan.

278
00:16:51,383 --> 00:16:54,616
Apa yang ada di lantai 1?

279
00:16:54,639 --> 00:16:59,072
Di lantai 1 ada patung-patung kuno.

280
00:16:59,095 --> 00:17:02,680
Saya tidak perlu melihat patungnya.

281
00:17:02,704 --> 00:17:07,371
Kalau begitu, silakan naik lift ke lantai 2.

282
00:17:07,394 --> 00:17:10,660
Apakah lantai 2 luas?

283
00:17:10,683 --> 00:17:13,950
Cukup luas.

284
00:17:13,973 --> 00:17:17,289
Saya khawatir akan tersesat.

285
00:17:17,312 --> 00:17:21,286
Sebaiknya bawa brosur.

286
00:17:21,310 --> 00:17:25,011
Di mana saya bisa mendapatkan brosur?

287
00:17:25,034 --> 00:17:28,701
Brosur ada di konter depan pintu masuk.

288
00:17:28,724 --> 00:17:30,857
Terima kasih.

289
00:17:30,880 --> 00:17:35,662
Lukisan terkenal diberi tanda merah.

290
00:17:35,685 --> 00:17:39,069
Itu memudahkan ya.

291
00:17:39,093 --> 00:17:42,449
Bolehkah saya mengambil foto?

292
00:17:42,472 --> 00:17:45,985
Mohon jangan mengambil foto.

293
00:17:46,009 --> 00:17:48,642
Baiklah.

294
00:17:48,665 --> 00:17:51,055
Baik, saya akan berhati-hati.

295
00:17:51,078 --> 00:17:53,866
Pintu keluar ada di sebelah sana.

296
00:17:53,890 --> 00:17:57,223
Baik, saya pergi dulu.

297
00:17:57,246 --> 00:17:58,746
Scene 10: Cara Menikmati Onsen

298
00:17:58,746 --> 00:18:04,046
Saya ingin berendam onsen di sekitar sini.

299
00:18:04,069 --> 00:18:07,702
Ada berbagai macam onsen lho.

300
