327
00:20:00,188 --> 00:20:04,268
Airnya mungkin agak panas.

328
00:20:04,291 --> 00:20:07,558
Saya akan hati-hati.

329
00:20:07,581 --> 00:20:10,847
Silakan nikmati dengan santai.

